---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How VidPace uses the details you send us.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="display h1">Privacy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section tight" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you request an audit or book a call, we receive your name, email, channel link and anything you write in the form. Booking is handled by Calendly under its own privacy policy.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>Only to prepare your audit, reply to you and follow up about our services. We don't sell or share your details.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Vercel Web Analytics to count visits. It doesn't use cookies or track you across other sites.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>Reply to any email from us to ask what we hold about you or to have it deleted.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
